{
  "name": "Rmw_cc10",
  "comment": "cc=10 read-modify-write + LD/ST + INC/DEC class. aaa selects op: 000=ASL, 001=ROL, 010=LSR, 011=ROR, 100=STX, 101=LDX, 110=DEC, 111=INC. bbb addressing modes are op-specific (some bbb values illegal per op — those become unofficial NOPs/KILs in unofficial.json). Common modes: bbb=001=zp, 010=A(accumulator)/=#imm for LDX, 011=abs, 101=zp,X (or zp,Y for STX/LDX), 111=abs,X (or abs,Y for LDX). Many holes in this 8x8 matrix → unofficial opcodes.",
